    </p><a href="/">← Home</a><pagefind-searchbox></pagefind-searchbox><script type="module" src="/pagefind/pagefind-component-ui.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="/static/pagefind.js"></script><h1 class="instruction-section" data-pagefind-body="1" data-pagefind-weight="10" data-pagefind-sort="title">ST1 (multiple structures)</h1><p class="insn_subtitle" data-pagefind-body="1">Store multiple single-element structures from one, two, three, or four registers</p>
      <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">This instruction stores elements to memory from one, two, three, or four
SIMD&amp;FP registers, without interleaving. Every element of each register is stored.</p>
      <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">Depending on the settings in the CPACR_EL1,
  CPTR_EL2, and CPTR_EL3 registers,
  and the current Security state and Exception level,
  an attempt to execute the instruction might be trapped.</p>
    
    <p class="desc">
      It has encodings from 2 classes:
      <a href="#iclass_no_offset">No offset</a>
       and 
      <a href="#iclass_post_index">Post-index</a>
    </p>
    <h3 class="classheading"><a id="iclass_no_offset"></a>No offset class
        <span style="font-size:smaller;"><br></br>(FEAT_AdvSIMD)
          </span></h3><p class="desc"></p><div class="regdiagram-32"><table class="regdiagram"><thead><tr><td>31</td><td>30</td><td>29</td><td>28</td><td>27</td><td>26</td><td>25</td><td>24</td><td>23</td><td>22</td><td>21</td><td>20</td><td>19</td><td>18</td><td>17</td><td>16</td><td>15</td><td>14</td><td>13</td><td>12</td><td>11</td><td>10</td><td>9</td><td>8</td><td>7</td><td>6</td><td>5</td><td>4</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>0</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="firstrow"><td class="lr">0</td><td class="lr">Q</td><td class="l">0</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="lr">0</td><td class="l">0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="l">x</td><td>x</td><td>1</td><td class="r">x</td><td colspan="2" class="lr">size</td><td colspan="5" class="lr">Rn</td><td colspan="5" class="lr">Rt</td></tr><tr class="secondrow"><td></td><td></td><td colspan="7"></td><td class="droppedname">L</td><td colspan="6"></td><td colspan="4" class="droppedname">opcode</td><td colspan="2"></td><td colspan="5"></td><td colspan="5"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="encoding"><div class="encoding__label"><h4 class="encoding">One register encoding
